maladministration%2C%20and%20danger%20to%20health%20or%20safety%20under%20the%20PID%20Act%202013%20%E2%80%94%20and%20then%20declined%20to%20act%20on%20procedural%20grounds.%0A%0AI%20am%20requesting%3A%0A1.%20A%20formal%20parliamentary%20inquiry%20into%20the%20documented%20conduct%20of%20the%20agencies%20named%20in%20the%20archive%0A2.%20A%20review%20of%20the%20Public%20Interest%20Disclosure%20Act%202013%20and%20whether%20it%20is%20fit%20for%20purpose%0A3.%20Parliamentary%20acknowledgment%20of%20the%20documented%20harm%0A%0AThe%20full%20archive%20is%20publicly%20available%20at%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%20%E2%80%94%20free%20to%20access%2C%20blockchain-sealed%2C%20and%20AI-verified.%20Dr.%20McLean%20is%20available%20for%20comment%20at%20drbarrandodger%40proton.me.%0A%0AYours%20sincerely%2C%0A%5BYour%20Name%5D%0A%5BYour%20Electorate%5D)>>>>
